== Trivia ==
* "Forget me now" is a reference to the show [[wikipedia:Arrested Development|''Arrested Development'']], in which Gob the magician gives people who have figured out how he does a trick a "Forget-me-now", which is a [[wikipedia:Flunitrazepam|Roofie]].
** The phrase "Forget me now" is also a play on words of the flower "Forget me not".
* The 5 pip {{R|Dice Room}} has the same effect as Forget Me Now.
* {{i|Plan C}} has the same sprite as Forget Me Now tinted red.
* In the original ''Binding of Isaac'', this item was present in the {{R|Devil Room}} item pool. It was restored to that pool in ''Repentance''.

